WEBVTT

00:00:08.715 --> 00:00:11.426
- Freaks.
- There, there, mistress.

00:00:11.676 --> 00:00:15.013
Scum of the earth.
Not like it was in the days of my fathers.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.678
Kreacher is here.

00:00:21.853 --> 00:00:23.313
Oh, Harry.

00:00:26.107 --> 00:00:29.575
Are you all right? We overheard them
talking about the Dementor attack.

00:00:30.111 --> 00:00:32.948
-You must tell us everything.
-Let the man breathe, Hermione.

00:00:33.114 --> 00:00:36.607
And this hearing at the Ministry.
It's just outrageous.

00:00:37.494 --> 00:00:39.113
I've looked it up.
They simply can't expel you.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.571
-It's completely unfair.
-Yeah.

00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:44.649
There's a lot of that
going round at the moment.

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.046
So, what is this place?

00:00:49.673 --> 00:00:52.384
-It's headquarters.
-Of the Order of the Phoenix.

00:00:53.176 --> 00:00:54.468
It's a secret society.

00:00:54.845 --> 00:00:57.059
Dumbledore formed it back when
they fought You-Know-Who.

00:00:57.556 --> 00:00:59.061
Couldn't have put any of this
in a letter, I suppose?

00:01:00.809 --> 00:01:02.699
I've gone all summer
without a scrap of news.

00:01:03.603 --> 00:01:05.952
We wanted to write, mate.
Really, we did.

00:01:07.399 --> 00:01:08.441
-Only....
-Only what?

00:01:08.608 --> 00:01:10.500
Only Dumbledore made us swear
not to tell you anything.

00:01:13.613 --> 00:01:14.703
Dumbledore said that?

00:01:16.937 --> 00:01:19.480
But why would he keep me in the dark?
Maybe I could help.

00:01:20.036 --> 00:01:21.997
I'm the one who saw Voldemort return...

00:01:22.163 --> 00:01:25.000
...the one who fought him,
who saw Cedric Diggory get killed.

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:27.377
- Harry.
- Thought we heard your dulcet tones.

00:01:27.544 --> 00:01:29.921
Don't bottle it up,
though, mate. Let it out.

00:01:30.088 --> 00:01:31.590
If you're all done shouting....

00:01:31.756 --> 00:01:33.849
Do you wanna hear something
a little more interesting?

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.054
If anyone has a right to know, it's Harry.

00:01:38.221 --> 00:01:41.141
If it wasn't for Harry, we wouldn't
even know Voldemort was back.

00:01:41.308 --> 00:01:42.893
He's not a child, Molly.

00:01:43.059 --> 00:01:45.437
But he's not an adult either.

00:01:45.729 --> 00:01:48.648
- He's not James, Sirius.
- Well, he's not your son.

00:01:48.815 --> 00:01:50.144
He's as good as.

00:01:51.359 --> 00:01:53.069
- Who else has he got?
- Hey, Ginny.

00:01:53.236 --> 00:01:55.655
- He's got me.
- How touchingly paternal, Black.

00:01:55.822 --> 00:01:58.950
Perhaps Potter will grow up to be a felon,
just like his godfather.

00:01:59.117 --> 00:02:00.869
Now, you stay out of this, Snivellus.

00:02:01.036 --> 00:02:02.954
-Snape's part of the Order?
-Git.

00:02:03.121 --> 00:02:04.581
--about your supposed reformation.

00:02:05.957 --> 00:02:08.043
- I know better.
- So why don't you tell him?

00:02:08.209 --> 00:02:09.920
- Get off it.
- Quick.

00:02:10.086 --> 00:02:11.713
-Get it up.
-Crookshanks.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.299
- Stop it.
- Get off, you b***dy cat.

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:16.718
-Crookshanks. Leave it alone.
-Get it up.

00:02:18.678 --> 00:02:21.306
- Hermione, I hate your cat.
- Bad Crookshanks.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.144
Well, we'll be eating down in the kitchen.

00:02:26.311 --> 00:02:27.354
Oh!

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.522
Just because you're allowed
to use magic now...

00:02:29.689 --> 00:02:32.734
...does not mean you have to
whip your wands out for everything.

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.486
Hi, Mum.

00:02:35.487 --> 00:02:36.707
You hungry, Harry?

00:02:37.364 --> 00:02:39.611
You sure you're all right, Harry?
Gave us quite a turn.

00:02:40.158 --> 00:02:41.477
Harry Potter.

00:02:44.537 --> 00:02:45.708
Sirius.

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:49.834
Ohh.

00:02:52.212 --> 00:02:53.630
This is very, very peculiar.

00:02:55.006 --> 00:02:58.301
It seems your hearing at the Ministry
is to be before the entire Wizengamot.

00:02:58.468 --> 00:03:01.805
I don't understand. What has
the Ministry of Magic got against me?

00:03:02.722 --> 00:03:05.222
Show him. He'll find out soon enough.

00:03:16.528 --> 00:03:18.761
He's been attacking Dumbledore as well.

00:03:21.366 --> 00:03:25.861
Fudge is using all his power, including
his influence at the Daily Prophet...

00:03:26.705 --> 00:03:29.708
...to smear anyone who claims
the Dark Lord has returned.

00:03:29.874 --> 00:03:30.877
Why?

00:03:31.034 --> 00:03:33.294
He thinks Dumbledore's after his job.

00:03:33.461 --> 00:03:35.588
No one in their right mind
could believe that--

00:03:35.755 --> 00:03:38.633
Exactly the point.
Fudge isn't in his right mind.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.344
It's been twisted and warped by fear.

00:03:43.013 --> 00:03:45.432
Now, fear makes people
do terrible things, Harry.

00:03:45.598 --> 00:03:48.059
The last time Voldemort gained power...

00:03:48.226 --> 00:03:50.953
...he almost destroyed
everything we hold most dear.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:55.650
Now he's returned, and I'm afraid
the minister will do almost anything...

00:03:55.817 --> 00:03:58.737
...to avoid facing that terrifying truth.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:03.211
We think Voldemort
wants to build up his army again.

00:04:05.827 --> 00:04:08.496
Fourteen years ago,
he had huge numbers at his command.

00:04:08.663 --> 00:04:12.301
And not just witches and wizards,
but all manner of dark creatures.

00:04:13.835 --> 00:04:17.131
He's been recruiting heavily, and
we've been attempting to do the same.

00:04:18.798 --> 00:04:21.594
But gathering followers
isn't the only thing he's interested in.

00:04:25.513 --> 00:04:26.648
We believe...

00:04:28.308 --> 00:04:30.078
...Voldemort may be after something.

00:04:30.435 --> 00:04:31.561
Sirius.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:37.157
Something he didn't have last time.

00:04:39.527 --> 00:04:41.571
You mean like a weapon?

00:04:41.738 --> 00:04:45.104
No. That's enough. He's just a boy.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.787
You say more and you might as well
induct him into the Order.

00:04:48.813 --> 00:04:52.069
Good. I want to join. If Voldemort's
raising an army, then I want to fight.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.097
Harry.

00:05:07.263 --> 00:05:09.516
You are hereby expelled.

00:05:09.682 --> 00:05:12.477
Before the entire Wizengamot.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.613
Trains. Underground.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.244
Ingenious, these Muggles.

00:05:38.294 --> 00:05:39.712
Ahh.

00:05:43.018 --> 00:05:44.093
Here we are.

00:05:46.886 --> 00:05:50.189
I've never used the visitors' entrance
before. Should be fun.

00:05:52.058 --> 00:05:55.286
Right. Good.
I'll just get my Muggle money.

00:06:36.394 --> 00:06:39.314
Terrible. Lost a lot of Galleons
trading on the potions market.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.775
Daily Prophet, ladies and
gentlemen. Anybody for Daily Prophet?

00:06:42.942 --> 00:06:44.815
Dumbledore: Is he daft,
or is he dangerous?

